 production-ready devices, the Nicla family fits professional workflows that require compact hardware, long-term support , and reliable embedded performance . Read more. Compare Select this product to display a comparison dialog. Nicla Voice Arduino The 22.86 x 22.86 mm Nicla Voice allows for easy implementation of always-on speech recognition on the edge, because it integrates Syntiant’s powerful NDP120 Neural Decision processor to run multip... Original price €0,00 - Original price €0,00 Original price €0,00 €55,30 €55,30 - €55,30 Current price €55,30 | / 4.0 Compare Select this product to display a comparison dialog. Nicla Sense ME Arduino The Nicla Sense ME is a tiny, low-power tool that sets a new standard for intelligent sensing solutions. With the simplicity of integration and scalability of the Arduino ecosystem, the board combi... Original price €55,30 - Original price €55,30 Original price €55,30 €55,30 - €55,30 Current price €55,30 | / 4.5 Compare Select this product to display a comparison dialog. Nicla Vision Arduino Nicla Vision allows you to build your next smart project. Ever wanted an automated house? Or a smart garden? Well, now it’s easy with the Arduino IoT Cloud compatible boards. It means: you can conn... Original price €89,80 - Original price €89,80 Original price €89,80 €89,80 - €89,80 Current price €89,80 | / 4.9 Compare Select this product to display a comparison dialog. Nicla Sense Env Arduino Expand your Portenta or MKR projects with Nicla Sense Env, and start sensing the world around you. Add a single module to combine three state-of-the-art sensors from Renesas® with the simplicity of... Original price €42,70 - Original price €42,70 Original price €42,70 €42,70 - €42,70 Current price €42,70 | / 5.0 Sort by Featured Most relevant Best selling Alphabetically, A-Z Alphabetically, Z-A Price, low to high Price, high to low Date, old to new Date, new to old Region Back to top Follow us Newsletter Shipping Policy Payment Methods Sales Conditio